---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<PageLayout meta={{ title: '关于', description: '关于刘辰旭：计算机硕士研究生，研究三维场景理解与视觉语言学习。' }}>
  <main class='academic-page simple-page'>
    <p class='eyebrow'>ABOUT / 关于</p>
    <h1 class='page-title'>刘辰旭</h1>
    <p class='page-intro'>计算机硕士研究生（研三），目前聚焦三维场景理解与视觉语言学习，并准备博士阶段的研究。</p>

    <section class='about-section section-rule'>
      <p class='section-kicker'>研究</p>
      <div>
        <h2>我正在关注什么</h2>
        <p>围绕三维场景理解和视觉语言任务开展研究。当前两项工作分别投稿至 IEEE Transactions on Multimedia 和 IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology；具体题目与审稿状态见<a class='academic-link' href='/#research'>研究成果</a>。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class='about-section section-rule'>
      <p class='section-kicker'>写作</p>
      <div>
        <h2>研究之外</h2>
        <p>我也写现代诗。诗歌会逐步整理到<a class='academic-link' href='/poetry'>诗歌栏目</a>；研究过程中的技术笔记将放在<a class='academic-link' href='/blog'>技术博客</a>。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class='about-section section-rule'>
      <p class='section-kicker'>联系</p>
      <div>
        <h2>找到我</h2>
        <p><a class='academic-link' href='https://github.com/ChaseXLiu' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>GitHub ↗</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .simple-page { padding-top: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem); }
  .about-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 10rem 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 2.2rem 0; }
  .about-section h2 { margin-bottom: .7rem; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .about-section p:not(.section-kicker) { max-width: 44rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); line-height: 1.9; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .about-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .7rem; } }
</style>
